{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>For an everlasting possession, and I will be.</b> To you <b>for Elohim</b> — so that you may fulfill My will in it [the land], as in: וַיִּתֵּן לָהֶם אַרְצוֹת גּוֹיִם בַּעֲבוּר יִשְׁמְרוּ חֻקָּיו (Psalms 105:44–45). And through this I will be for you for Elohim, so that you may be eternal in the man."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:24.696126592Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}